    "user": "U08JASQKEEM",
    "type": "message",
    "ts": "1764813700.667749",
    "client_msg_id": "dac86cee-970a-4289-9008-ed2d47812cdd",
    "text": "1password は業務で使っていますが、 めちゃくちゃ良いですね\n<https://developer.1password.com/docs/cli/secrets-scripts/>\n.env には `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=<op://prod/aws/secret-key>` みたいに書いておいて\n`op run --env-file yourscript.env -- yourscript.sh` で実行すると、ローカルディスクに一度も秘密鍵を書き出すことなくプロセスに直接値を渡せます。",
    "team": "T08FL58DC9K",
    "thread_ts": "1764762994.906609",
    "parent_user_id": "U08NZH1RY4S",
    "attachments": [
      {
        "image_url": "https://developer.1password.com/img/meta-og-image.png",
        "image_width": 1200,
        "image_height": 628,
        "image_bytes": 23899,
        "from_url": "https://developer.1password.com/docs/cli/secrets-scripts/",
        "service_icon": "https://developer.1password.com/img/favicon.ico",
        "id": 1,
        "original_url": "https://developer.1password.com/docs/cli/secrets-scripts/",
        "fallback": "Load secrets into scripts | 1Password Developer",
        "text": "Learn how to use secret references to securely load secrets in your scripts.",
        "title": "Load secrets into scripts | 1Password Developer",
        "title_link": "https://developer.1password.com/docs/cli/secrets-scripts/",
        "service_name": "developer.1password.com"
      }
    ],
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "rich_text",
        "block_id": "Pn1+g",
        "elements": [
          {
            "type": "rich_text_section",
            "elements": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1password は業務で使っていますが、 めちゃくちゃ良いですね\n"
              },
              {
                "type": "link",
                "url": "https://developer.1password.com/docs/cli/secrets-scripts/"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "\n.env には "
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=",
                "style": {
                  "code": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "link",
                "url": "op://prod/aws/secret-key",
                "style": {
                  "code": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " みたいに書いておいて\n"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "op run --env-file yourscript.env -- yourscript.sh",
                "style": {
                  "code": true
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " で実行すると、ローカルディスクに一度も秘密鍵を書き出すことなくプロセスに直接値を渡せます。"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "parent_ts": "1764762994.906609",
    "user_name": "Ohkubo KOHEI (kuboon)",
    "text_readable": "1password は業務で使っていますが、 めちゃくちゃ良いですね\n<https://developer.1password.com/docs/cli/secrets-scripts/>\n.env には `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=<op://prod/aws/secret-key>` みたいに書いておいて\n`op run --env-file yourscript.env -- yourscript.sh` で実行すると、ローカルディスクに一度も秘密鍵を書き出すことなくプロセスに直接値を渡せます。"
